SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10
    Ba        5

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 rate = 10
20 moles = rate * TIME * 1e-5
30 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -formula Calcite 1
        -m      1.0
        -m0     1.0
    -cvode false
    -steps 1000 in 100 steps

PRINT
    -reset false
